            <ArticleTitle>IVUS makes important strides in 2005.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>337-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Researchers utilized intravascular ultrasound in unique ways in 2005, from assessing transplant vasculopathy to evaluating long-term drug-eluting stent outcomes to identifying predictors of stent thrombosis. These and other applications signify key developments in the field of intravascular imaging.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
